  <item>
    <title>EP09 北大x复旦:在喜剧top2办脱口秀是什么体验？ft.小鱼&amp;谢谢&amp;赵阿德</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672828b9cbe0e69c8be08934</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672828b9cbe0e69c8be08934</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 02:00:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@趣听喜剧</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/624db65400000000100052f0?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680547&amp;share_id=a871e5455a1a4daa8de544c76abd968d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/624db65400000000100052f0?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680547&amp;share_id=a871e5455a1a4daa8de544c76abd968d"><span>小鱼</span></a><strong><span>、@趣听喜剧</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c4d296000000001b02698c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680578&amp;share_id=a89b80c80f5f4acaa3a6ecc73df3dbf0" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c4d296000000001b02698c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680578&amp;share_id=a89b80c80f5f4acaa3a6ecc73df3dbf0"><span>谢谢</span></a><strong><span>、@</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6281216a0000000021026d24?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680610&amp;share_id=9b703047fb9945e6870fc1b99ebcbbaa" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6281216a0000000021026d24?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b6e677bc9010a000109f491&amp;apptime=1730680610&amp;share_id=9b703047fb9945e6870fc1b99ebcbbaa"><span>高笑喜剧赵阿德</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^</span><strong><span>可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享</span></strong><span>，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>（不出意外的话）</span></strong></em><span>周三更新，两周一更~</span></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><span>听取哇声一片</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>近期准备开启第二季！如果你也是“资深观众”，如果你也想一起聊聊你眼中的喜剧，</span><strong><span>欢迎联系主播夏雨荷（小红书私信@夏雨荷今天饿了么）</span></strong><span>期待你的声音！</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>回来吧主播丢失的四段素材😭</span></p><span></span><p><span>封存大半年的一段播客，其中有大量</span><strong><span>过期但好笑</span></strong><span>的内容（比如</span><em><span>赵老板当时还在写论文</span></em><span>）（比如当时</span><em><span>小鱼还不是男明星</span></em><span>）（比如这期</span><em><span>播客录制的时候被突发状况打断了7次</span></em><span>）......</span></p><span></span><p><span>真的特别好笑，已经尽量调小当事人们的笑声了～但还是建议</span><strong><span>调小音量食用</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 北大趣听喜剧编年史（？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 喜剧从基层干起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 然后我嘎就当上了团支书！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 复旦旦口喜剧创业史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 国内首批打入线上top1平台的脱口秀节目原来是旦口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 谁说做喜剧赚的？这喜剧太赔了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> </span><em><strong><span>突发事件之赵。老。板。话。筒。没。接。上。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 怎么办！脱口秀开放麦（top2版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 嚯！趣听喜剧演员人均有个粉丝群？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 只要不卖票，票就不难卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 校内演出可以讲内部梗，校外演出观众更刺激</span></p><span></span><p><span>（回旋镖之还有可能上热搜）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 喜剧问答，启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 宫廷玉液酒多少一杯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 讲脱口秀是为了克服考年级第一后的演讲恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 咱e人从小就爱国旗下讲话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 想表演脱口秀，老师问我是不是缺个搭档？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 写笑话也要ddl驱动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> 写段子先攒情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 赵老板写不出新段子的原因（自称）：写论文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 小鱼讲脱口秀全靠刷题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 喜剧演员长相和表演状态也是天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 刚开始觉得自己有天赋，后来天赋走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 至今看不得自己的演出视频（现在呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> </span><em><strong><span>突发事件之剧场试音于是我们有了bgm和beat</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> 场子冷了怎么办？——加衣服啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> 冷不冷场多少沾点玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2261">37:41</a> 小鱼：观众眼里的我应该是幽默小哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 谢谢：观众眼里的我应该是傻子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a> </span><em><strong><span>突发事件之赵阿德爆改沙棘</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 沙棘：观众不喜欢我（记仇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 我就这样看待恶评：记一辈子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> </span><em><strong><span>突发事件之赵老板走的时候把麦关了</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 沙棘收到的差评是侧脸很好看？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 小鱼“塌房”真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 谢谢在新人赛被投过十几票“不喜欢”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">46:01</a> 喜剧演员临死前上脱6的幻想belike</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a> 我不上旦口喜剧大赛，那不是怕输吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 未来专场计划（幻想时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2893">48:13</a> 不仅要测专场，还要一周一测！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2998">49:58</a> 兼顾喜剧、恋爱和学业是不可能三角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3224">53:44</a> 小鱼喜欢观点型段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3274">54:34</a> 谢谢喜欢邪门包袱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 不喜欢的演员：沙棘不喜欢教主？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> 会一直做喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>推荐演员：子寅、梁海源、黄子华</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>————————————————</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：《NIGHT DANCER》——明透</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期预告：好梦</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltaHnBXByMI1O8laVYBWs5X8-ojp.m4a" length="63745834" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlAHPJPTnnLd2uNZZcBSuND0BTX.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP08 脱口秀综艺幕后的故事：什么？我接付航？！feat.王越</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671270f3db2cf827573d839d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671270f3db2cf827573d839d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Oct 2024 14:30:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@王越、@炸猪排</span></strong></p><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^</span><strong><span>可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享</span></strong><span>，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><p><strong><em><span>（不出意外的话）</span></em></strong><span>周三更新，两周一更~</span></p><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><span>听取哇声一片</span></a></p><p><span>近期准备开启第二季！如果你也是“资深观众”，如果你也想一起聊聊你眼中的喜剧，</span><strong><span>欢迎联系主播夏雨荷（小红书私信@夏雨荷今天饿了么）</span></strong><span>期待你的声音！</span></p><p><span>————————————————</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 本期话题：脱口秀综艺幕后二三事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 单立人？没听说过，是什么地方小俱乐部吗？（危！）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 单立人原创喜剧大赛年度季军是怎样炼成的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 被观众喜欢比晋级更重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 插曲之死去的旦口喜剧大赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> “没人告诉过我要接付航啊！！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 从没想过综艺录制现场这么难讲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> 演员们现场表现和得票情况真的相符吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 未解之谜：王越为什么在节目上一直穿卫衣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> 写段子的速度赶不上晋级的速度是什么体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 把专场拆了放到线上合适不？</span></p><p><span>————————————————</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 喜剧问答，启动！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 喜剧氛围就这样培养：我们家有自己的春晚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 这些脱口秀演员是咋上的节目啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 王越的创作方法：聊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">23:49</a> 文曲星太旺，造就天选喜剧人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 第一场商演就很炸的演员后来怎么样了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 暖暖的嘻哈和PAN老师～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 王越的舞台人格：老少咸宜，憨态可掬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 上综艺的心路历程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 八卦时间：为啥选了喜单没选脱ta（能播版）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 专场诞生记：PAN老师把ddl扔这了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 第一次专场内测在台上哭了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 喜欢莫名其妙的段子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a> “不喜欢的演员？那还真有点多——”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> 推荐俱乐部：</span><strong><span>成都后仰喜剧、厦门来疯喜剧</span></strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;推荐专场：</span><strong><span>嘻哈-《茁壮》（全国巡演中）</span></strong></p><p><span>————————————————</span></p><p><span>王越推歌：《泪桥》—伍佰</span></p><p><span>本期BGM：《Memories》—大槻真希</span></p>]]></description>
