  <item>
    <title>EP07 脱口秀是一种很玄的东西 feat.阿PAN&amp;翟佳宁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0f4ac7349f7a557f5fa29</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b0f4ac7349f7a557f5fa29</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 15:50:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@阿PAN、翟佳宁、沙棘</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（不出意外的话）</span></strong><span>周三更新，两周一更~</span></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><span>听取哇声一片</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 本期话题：玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 给妈祖讲个段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 翟佳宁：只信本命年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 沙棘和他的红裤衩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 都不信，但全算过。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> PAN老师mbti大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 上辈子得是大好人这辈子才能是gay</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> 喜剧问答，启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> “我瞅谁都笑不出来！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> let's怀念最早的吐槽大会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 创作习惯：纯天然vs纯硬写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> “读稿会完全是浪费时间！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 东北真是喜剧地狱吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> “真诚”是不是伪命题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> </span><em><span>（彩蛋：上一期犊子老师的预言还真实现了）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> 恶评点评时间到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> “你恐同吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> let's怀念互联网1v1对线的年代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 上综艺好。但会遮住PAN老师的腹肌！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2881">48:01</a> 有些话题只有出了名的人才能讲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 理论上《望子成凤》可以演一辈子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 感觉观众在慢慢放弃脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a>“可能我们才是姜昆，他们是郭德纲”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3476">57:56</a> 喜欢的段子：傻x梗、简单真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3547">59:07</a> 不喜欢的演员/圈内现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3735">01:02:15</a> 推荐：</span><strong><span>良言《哎呀再说吧》、汤姆布雷迪《吐槽大会》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（阿PAN：“你当年推荐我的！！”）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3911">01:05:11</a> “等到哪天有那么一个演员能在梅奔开专场，就说明这个行业存在了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3941">01:05:41</a> </span><strong><span>特别环节！！阿PAN&amp;大翟歌单推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《花桥流水》——高安/纳兰珠儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Nightingale》——雅尼</span></p><span></span><p><span>《搜神记》——容祖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一放工菊花都放松》——新青年理发厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢包容不定期更新T_T本期高质量访谈送给还没取关的大家~</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎许愿！！（高笑喜剧你也是越来越出息了、、）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：《7rings》——尤超白</span></em></p>]]></description>
