    <title>EP06 三十而累的泌尿科大夫，爱看宝可梦？！feat.犊子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6687a49f0bc5d7cc700770fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6687a49f0bc5d7cc700770fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 07:45:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@犊子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>（不出意外的话）周三更新，两周一更~</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><span>听取哇声一片</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题：电子榨菜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 犊子老师居然是夏雨荷的粉丝??</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 下饭必看咒术回战和宝可梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> “我不看中国人演的电视剧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 宝可梦里印象最深刻的名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 不爱看新番的原因：没有安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 周边快闪达咩，唯爱免费看番</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 电子榨菜之京腔大爷聊古代冷兵器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 树枝对直男的杀伤力到底有多大</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 喜剧问答启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> “我爸是现实版胡建林！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 犊子眼中的天赋型演员和努力型演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 舞台上的所有东西都可能是设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 台上冷场？我会阿巴阿巴阿巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> 人设关键词——“社畜人夫感”？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 特别听劝的脱口秀演员如何看恶评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 听观众劝，但别听演员劝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 我不上喜剧综艺是因为不喜欢吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a></span><strong><span> 《三十而累》</span></strong><span>诞生记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 讲单口最大的困难：上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 不喜欢，但能理解的一类演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 不喜欢的圈内现象：吸毒（？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 原来医生和喜剧演员都是白头行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 推荐大风天喜剧所有专场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 预期是头部演员吃肉，咱喝汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 题外话：真正的东北大哥是咋样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听！！本期又是在户外录制所以会有些杂音、、主播的声音录出来很小但犊子老师的声音还是比较清晰滴！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下期预告：翟佳宁、阿Pan——《玄学无处不在》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>近期演出：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cRmRFYq_90Asbh9CrjIFaw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cRmRFYq_90Asbh9CrjIFaw"><span>小菊《难能可柜》</span></a><span>（有全女场次噢！！）</span></p>]]></description>
