    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@王十七、喵丸、炸猪排</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（不出意外的话）周三更新，两周一更~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><span>听取哇声一片</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于终于更新！断更这么久真是特别不好意思的、、</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是五月恢复更新是真的！</span><strong><span>请订阅~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> 让我看看是谁爱吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 王十七爱生气？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> 难忘的吵架经历belike</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 各位嘉宾吵架技巧大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> “你臭不要脸！！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 喜剧问答，启动——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 第一次线下就看周奇墨的专场是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2551">42:31</a> 人工心脏是“天降素材”吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 没有天赋型演员，努力谁都能做好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">48:44</a> 希望给经历相似的观众带来鼓舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">50:24</a> 如何看待对自己的差评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3104">51:44</a> 上综艺前后有啥变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3275">54:35</a> 太能写了！第二个专场诞生就是顺其自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> 写段子会被技巧“困住”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">01:01:04</a> 不喜欢的演员：赛道不同，不理解但尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3803">01:03:23</a> 每年一个公益专场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3862">01:04:22</a> 王十七优选专场：</span><strong><span>刘旸教主《身心俱疲》、毛冬《沉舟》、良言《哎呀再说吧》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>再次为断更致歉T-T</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《不摇滚》——告五人、八三夭乐团</span></p>]]></description>
