  <item>
    <title>EP04 在喜剧里，听见她们的声音 feat.王梓晗&amp;趴体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fa5477696bd9a8793f24af</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fa5477696bd9a8793f24af</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Mar 2024 03:13:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@王梓晗、趴体、喵丸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由</span><strong><span>上海高笑喜剧</span></strong><span>出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（不出意外的话）</span></strong><span>周三更新，两周一更~</span></p><span></span><p><span>不更新的时候来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span><a href="https://studio.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/view/knhjqjb6kj" data-url="https://studio.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/view/knhjqjb6kj"><em><span>听取哇声一片</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>【topic】合作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 让我看看合作时谁爱当小领导？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> “一斤棉花一斤铁不是合作！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 我们如何应对突发状况：不应对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 趴体和梓晗互为“剧场判官”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 《她是你我》真的不演啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 办双拼的念头萌芽于“优等生综合症”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 《你们高笑喜剧这个团队遇到过什么突发情况吗》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> 再见爱人之原来我们是性缘关系、、</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 梓晗到底有没有说服趴体？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 有分歧无所谓，小范会发问卷星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 《她是你我》巡演遇到最大的困难是——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> 梓晗在这场双拼里的内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a> 未来还会做双拼吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 当复旦管理学子遇到商赛摆子</span></p><span></span><p><span>————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> 喜剧十二问启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">43:27</a> 趴体把“单口精神”带去了学校</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> 新人看书越多就越难上台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2903">48:23</a> 梓晗老师小课堂：写段子要一以贯之</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> 笑点不重要，事件要清晰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3408">56:48</a> 每天坚持创作的演员后来怎么样了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3749">1:02:29</a> 《她是你我》一开始也是ddl产物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4364">1:12:44</a> 冷场对我们来说也太不重要了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4690">1:18:10</a> 趴体和梓晗的夸夸时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4854">1:20:54</a> 后笑果时代，我们还要上喜剧综艺吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">1:24:00</a> 家人们谁懂啊？线下真的比线上强一百倍！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5321">1:28:41</a> 讲单口遇到最大的困难：内忧外患</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5301">1:28:21</a> 封箱和首演有啥不同的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6273">1:44:33</a> 我们讨厌这些圈内乱象：抄段子、睡粉、对女性不公、刷票......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6611">1:50:11</a> 我们做喜剧的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6778">1:52:58</a> 专场推荐：</span><strong><span>孙书恒《三堂会审伽利略》</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>James Acaster《冷千层面恨我自己1999》</span></strong><span>（b站）、</span><strong><span>步惊云《我和步惊云》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：《只喝香槟》Mr&amp;Miss</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>非常抱歉由于各种可抗力or不可抗力的因素本期播客原定3.8妇女节播出但拖到了这周、、、为表歉意明天将会加更一期</span><strong><span>嘉宾是王十七老师</span></strong><span>的笑友会！小小的播客大大的明星！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>并且《听取哇声一片》第二季也整装待发即将上线！敬请期待嗷~~</span></strong></p>]]></description>
