    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播@夏雨荷，本期嘉宾@徐指导、@吕盛典、@范辰健</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【笑友会】是由上海高笑喜剧出品的喜剧演员访谈播客，连线知名or即将知名的喜剧从业者、爱好者们们随便聊聊^_^可能好笑，可能有ta们关于创作、表演的干货分享，带听众朋友们走近舞台下的喜剧人🤭</span></p><span></span><p><span>不出意外的话双周周三更新，出意外的话视意外大小决定拖更or提前更新ovo</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>（不更新的那周来听主播的另一档单口观众访谈播客</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6546824fca85b8028ac61933"><em><span>听取哇声一片</span></em></a><em><span>）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> “改不掉的好习惯/坏习惯/怪习惯”</span></p><span></span><p><span>拖延&amp;迟到是人均顽固恶习！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>范老师：我只示范一次！让你们知道什么叫P人的极致。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 小时候说话结巴，但一讲笑话嘴皮子就利索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 上课给老师演个小品开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 因为太多人放鸽子，被笑果训练营补录了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 徐指导惊人的记忆力showtime...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 交给Storm的学费在喜剧联盒国演出赚回双倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 100%P人根本没法买票看演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 在旦口训练营拿了个“真敢奖”</span></p><span></span><p><span>（谐音梗统治世界、、、）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> 徐指导在不同阶段创作流程也不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 范老师创作时间=去开放麦的通勤时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 力求减少“无效开放麦”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 想要知名度，但不一定要上综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a> 聊聊《空壳》：专场不是这个价！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 三位老师讲单口遇到最大的困难：创作障碍、没计划、学医</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a> 写观点型段子发现笑点偏离前提咋办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 徐指导心中的好/坏段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 造人设比讲好笑话容易多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3133">52:13</a> 做喜剧的动力：别拿金罐头奖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">54:52</a> </span><strong><span>推荐演员：于祥宇、吴鼎、李梦杰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>推荐专场：大老王《局部和解》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>推荐俱乐部：大风天喜剧、喜番喜剧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3375">56:15</a> 既然外国演员能讲好笑干净段子，我们也能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3563">59:23</a> 观众能不能评价单口演员？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：LEMON TREE&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsq-YLKnHx6LkW3buWENSDN9-HXS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizCWkiOKEjOCd4VA3w8QJw1SFQ4.png"></figure>]]></description>
